> > may be optical or otherwise, hence x2 which may be light, sound, X-ray,
> > etc., default is light/optical lens; ka is refraction. See also kacma,
> > minra.
> >
> > Can it be other than {LE gusni}?
>
> Sound, as mentioned in the note.


